      "Day-by-Day Stool Culture Workflow (Takes 4-5 Days Total): Day 1 = Inoculate MacConkey, SS, MSRV, TCBS + Tetrathionate & Alkaline peptone broths. Day 2 = Subculture broths; pick colorless (MacConkey/SS), turbid halo (MSRV), or yellow/green (TCBS) colonies for biochemical screen (TSI, Lysine, Indole, Motility). Day 3 = Oxidase test (POSITIVE = Vibrio, Aeromonas, Plesiomonas; NEGATIVE = Enterobacterales [Salmonella, Shigella, E. coli]) + Slide Agglutination Serogrouping (O/H/Vi antisera) + Antimicrobial Susceptibility Testing (AST). Day 4-5 = Final report.",
