        "a": "• **Normal**: Homogeneous echo-texture, isoechoic or slightly hyperechoic to renal cortex.\n• **Fatty liver**: **Diffuse increased echogenicity ('bright liver')** with posterior acoustic beam attenuation and poor visualization of diaphragm/intrahepatic vessels."
